[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716939282","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114639#issuecomment-3716939282","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114639","id":3716939282,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7di_4S","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T01:16:12Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T01:16:12Z","body":"Please provide an MRP to make this easier to test and fix:\n\n* A small Godot project which reproduces the issue, with no unnecessary files included. Be sure to not include the .godot folder in the archive (but keep project.godot).\n* Having an MRP is very important for contributors to be able to reproduce the bug in the same way that you are experiencing it. When testing a potential fix for the issue, contributors will use the MRP to validate that the fix is working as intended.\n* Drag and drop a ZIP archive to upload it (max 10 MB). Do not select another field until the project is done uploading.\n\nI created a basic C# Project using Godot Mono 4.5.1 on my MacOS machine, and was unable to reproduce the issue with just your steps - retrieving `myLabel.Text` worked correctly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3716939282/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3722824792","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114639#issuecomment-3722824792","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114639","id":3722824792,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d5cxY","user":{"login":"jackauk","id":18533354,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTMzMzU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18533354?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk","html_url":"https://github.com/jackauk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jackauk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T08:44:17Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T08:46:35Z","body":"Today, I tested again and can not reproduce.  I remember that I enable/disable bbcode for the richtextbox. I try to enable/disable again. The result is that I can not reproduce.\nFortunately, when I run godot 4.5 project on godot 4.6, the engine clone my project with new name. I try at cloned project and can reproduce. When I compare 2 project I see that when engine use value default for BBCode, the error can reproduce \n\n<img width=\"2524\" height=\"352\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/69259dcc-3376-4af5-8241-4bbb447f0445\" />\nCompare 2 version, the left (has bbcode value) will run normally, the right (miss bbcode value) got the issue with the richtextlable.Text is empty\n<img width=\"3418\" height=\"1351\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b3119677-6269-41a8-81f0-55471c9a5804\" />\n\n<img width=\"2965\" height=\"727\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f07f067-a104-4e67-a2a7-9893cb507ee4\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3722824792/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727345376","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114639#issuecomment-3727345376","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114639","id":3727345376,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eKsbg","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T06:06:31Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T06:06:31Z","body":"@jackauk I have tested and recreated the issue on my machine, in Godot Mono 4.6 Beta 3, as well as GDScript Godot 4.5.1. I have attached a GDScript MRP.\n\n[gdrtl-text.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24520318/gdrtl-text.zip)\n\nThe behavior is consistent across both GDScript and C#, and from my testing does not vary based on BBCode enabled or not. It is based on the RichTextLabels Text property not being in sync with the Tag Stack when Text is added with RichTextLabel.add_text or RichTextLabel.append_text\n\n<img width=\"1009\" height=\"509\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d48de03c-eeef-4c12-abcc-c12defe5310a\" />\n\nSo in my screenshot here, I have an RTL with initial Text value \"Word\" - I append an Italics tagged word, and add a plain word. The text renders as expected in the scene, but when I print the Text property directly, it doesn't have either extra word, only the initial Text state. RichTextLabel.get_parsed_text() still accurately retrieves the rendered text, though with BBCode tags omitted. As far as I can tell, there is not currently a way to retrieve the full text of the RTL's Tag Stack. \n\nGoing to keep investigating! I'm yet to determine if this is the intended behavior - on the one hand there are a lot of warnings littered in RTL Documentation about Text & The Tag Stack being out of sync. On the other hand, it seems pretty unintuitive to me that there would be no way to retrieve a String of the full Text & Tag Stack. I also don't yet know if this is a regression from an earlier version, or if this has always been the behavior.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727345376/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727480030","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114639#issuecomment-3727480030","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114639","id":3727480030,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eLNTe","user":{"login":"ColinSORourke","id":44822820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODIyODIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44822820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke","html_url":"https://github.com/ColinSORourke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ColinSORourke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T07:01:33Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T07:03:50Z","body":"Update - this is a common, and well-discussed issue.\n\nA scroll through the issues page netted me 5 Duplicate Issues.\n\nSee: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105026\nSee: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100168\nSee: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/94630\nSee: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/79420\nSee: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/61260\n\nI would suggest these issues be consolidated, and we should investigate re-writing the documentation, or if this behavior can be improved without breaking compatibility.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3727480030/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3728332163","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114639#issuecomment-3728332163","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114639","id":3728332163,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eOdWD","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-09T10:32:41Z","updated_at":"2026-01-09T10:32:41Z","body":"Closing as a duplicate, thank you for reporting ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3728332163/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]